 F20 leaves topics unchanged.\n- [x] [operator-attested] F20 leaves the homepage unchanged.\n- [x] Every repository child passes its applicable local checks.\n- [x] [operator-attested] Every repository child receives LLM-Review +1 before merge.\n- [x] [operator-attested] Every repository child receives Verified +1 before merge.\n- [x] [operator-attested] The GitHub metadata child passes plan review before close.\n- [x] [operator-attested] The GitHub metadata child receives exact readback verification before close.\n- [x] [operator-attested] The repository batch is merged to `main`.\n- [x] [operator-attested] Every descendant closes without force.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"README.md","reason":"Changed by cosie-preodorous-grayfox, tigerseye-molecular-chamois, aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"docs/cli-reference.md","reason":"Changed by rubidium-fanatical-hog, immoderate-luxuriant-caiman."},{"path":"docs/config-reference.md","reason":"Changed by apish-obsequious-sablefish, chanceful-insectile-morpho."},{"path":"docs/config.md","reason":"Changed by opal-daffy-mutt."},{"path":"docs/event-schema.md","reason":"Changed by aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"docs/import-export.md","reason":"Changed by rubidium-fanatical-hog."},{"path":"docs/manifest-signing.md","reason":"Changed by aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"docs/mcp-reference.md","reason":"Changed by insentient-aware-anole."},{"path":"docs/plan-review-gate.md","reason":"Changed by aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"docs/repo-snapshot-gates.md","reason":"Changed by aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"docs/reuse-surface.md","reason":"Changed by aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"docs/sample-ticket-log.jsonl","reason":"Changed by aventurine-sharpcut-vampirebat."},{"path":"scripts/gen_cli_help.py","reason":"Changed by immoderate-luxuriant-caiman."},{"path":"scripts/gen_cli_reference.py","reason":"Changed by immoderate-luxuriant